<view class="page page-with-footer">

  <!-- 状态条 -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-title">后厨看板</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">更新于 {{updatedAt}} · {{closed ? '已截止，15 秒刷新一次' : '每 2 秒自动刷新'}}</view>
    <view class="hero-meta">
      <view class="hero-chip">{{closed ? '⏰ 已截止' : '🕒 截止 ' + deadlineText}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 统计 -->
  <view class="stats">
    <view class="stat">
      <view class="stat-num">{{stats.totalPeople}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label">到场人数</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <view class="stat-num">{{stats.orderCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label">已下单</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <view class="stat-num">{{stats.totalDishes}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label">总份数</view>
    </view>
    <view class="stat">
      <view class="stat-num">{{stats.dishKindCount}}</view>
      <view class="stat-label">菜品种类</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 菜品汇总 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>菜品汇总（按份数排序）</text>
      <text class="muted">{{dishTotals.length}} 种</text>
    </view>

    <view class="hint">不做的菜点右侧「不做」：会从所有人的订单里去掉它，并自动下架。</view>

    <view class="dt" wx:for="{{dishTotals}}" wx:key="dishId">
      <text class="dt-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</text>
      <view class="dt-main">
        <view class="dt-name">
          {{item.name}}
          <text class="dt-limit" wx:if="{{item.limitText}}">{{item.limitText}}</text>
          <text class="dt-like" wx:if="{{item.likeText}}">{{item.likeText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="dt-guests" wx:if="{{item.guestsText}}">{{item.guestsText}}</view>
        <view class="dt-note" wx:for="{{item.notes}}" wx:for-item="n" wx:key="*this">↳ {{n}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="dt-qty">×{{item.qty}}</view>
      <view class="dt-drop" catchtap="onDropDish" data-id="{{item.dishId}}" data-name="{{item.name}}">不做</view>
    </view>

    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !dishTotals.length}}">
      <text class="empty-emoji">🕰</text>
      <view>还没有人点单，把二维码或分享卡片发到群里吧</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 按人明细 -->
  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>按人明细</text>
      <text class="muted">{{orders.length}} 单</text>
    </view>

    <view class="warn" wx:if="{{hasHostOrder}}">
      ⚠️ 汇总里包含<span class="strong">你自己</span>的点单。如果那只是自测，去「我的点单」点一下「撤销」——否则人数和份数会偏多。
    </view>

    <view class="hint">点份数可以改成精确值，「−」减一份，「✕」整条去掉。</view>

    <view class="op" wx:for="{{orders}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="op-head">
        <text class="op-nick">
          {{item.nick}}
          <text class="op-badge" wx:if="{{item.isHost}}">主人自己的单</text>
        </text>
        <text class="op-meta">{{item.partySize}} 人<text wx:if="{{item.arriveAt}}"> · {{item.arriveAt}} 到</text> · {{item.totalQty}} 道</text>
      </view>

      <view class="op-item" wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="i" wx:key="key">
        <view class="op-item-main">
          <text class="op-item-name">{{i.emoji}} {{i.name}}</text>
          <text class="op-item-note" wx:if="{{i.note}}">{{i.note}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="op-item-ops">
          <text
            class="op-qty-btn"
            catchtap="onEditItemQty"
            data-order="{{item.orderId}}"
            data-dish="{{i.dishId}}"
            data-name="{{i.name}}"
            data-who="{{item.nick}}"
            data-qty="{{i.qty}}"
          >×{{i.qty}}</text>
          <text
            class="op-op-btn"
            catchtap="onDecItem"
            data-order="{{item.orderId}}"
            data-dish="{{i.dishId}}"
            data-name="{{i.name}}"
            data-who="{{item.nick}}"
            data-qty="{{i.qty}}"
          >−</text>
          <text
            class="op-op-btn op-op-drop"
            catchtap="onDropOrderItem"
            data-order="{{item.orderId}}"
            data-dish="{{i.dishId}}"
            data-name="{{i.name}}"
            data-who="{{item.nick}}"
          >✕</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="op-note" wx:if="{{item.note}}">整体备注：{{item.note}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !orders.length}}">
      <text class="empty-emoji">📭</text>
      <view>暂无点单记录</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 客人的点赞榜：吃完的反馈，下次家宴照着这张榜挑菜 -->
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{likes.length}}">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>👍 点赞榜（客人吃完投的）</text>
      <text class="muted">{{likeStats.voters}} 人参与</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">一人最多投 3 道，重复提交会覆盖。下次家宴挑菜时，照这张榜来最不容易翻车。</view>

    <view class="lk" wx:for="{{likes}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="lk-rank">{{item.medal || item.rank}}</text>
      <text class="lk-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</text>
      <view class="lk-main">
        <view class="lk-line">
          <text class="lk-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text class="lk-count">{{item.count}} 人赞</text>
        </view>
        <view class="lk-bar"><view class="lk-bar-in" style="width:{{item.barPercent}}%"></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:22rpx">
      <view class="btn" bindtap="onResetVotes">清空点赞</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">导出 / 复制</view>
    <view class="muted">三种清单各复制各的，都不含「谁点的」。「待购食材」已经扣掉家里本来就有的。</view>

    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:20rpx">
      <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onCopyMenu">复制菜单（发客人）</view>
    </view>
    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:16rpx">
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onCopyDishIngredient">复制菜 + 食材</view>
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onCopyShopping">复制待购食材</view>
    </view>
    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:16rpx">
      <view class="btn" bindtap="previewText">预览上次复制的</view>
      <view class="btn" bindtap="onRefresh">刷新数据</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 食材采购 -->
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{ingredientStats.total}}">
    <view class="card-title">
      <text>食材采购</text>
      <text class="muted">还要买 {{ingredientStats.missing}} / {{ingredientStats.total}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hint">
      买到了就点一下划掉。
      <block wx:if="{{ingredientStats.inStock}}">家里已有的 {{ingredientStats.inStock}} 项排在最后，带「家里有」标记，不用买。</block>
      <block wx:else>想让清单短一点，先去「家里的库存」记下家里有什么。</block>
    </view>

    <view class="ing-split" wx:if="{{ingredientStats.inStock}}">
      <text>还要买 {{ingredientStats.missing}}</text>
      <text>已买 {{ingredientStats.purchased}}</text>
      <text>家里有 {{ingredientStats.inStock}}</text>
    </view>

    <block wx:for="{{ingredients}}" wx:key="key">
      <view class="ing-head" wx:if="{{item.showStockHeader}}">🏠 以下家里已经有，不用买</view>
      <view
        class="ing {{item.inStock ? 'ing-stock' : ''}}"
        data-name="{{item.name}}"
        data-purchased="{{item.purchased ? 'off' : 'on'}}"
        bindtap="onToggleIngredient"
      >
        <view class="ing-box {{item.purchased ? 'ing-box-on' : ''}}">
          <text wx:if="{{item.purchased}}">✓</text>
        </view>
        <view class="ing-main">
          <view class="ing-name {{item.purchased ? 'ing-done' : ''}}">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="ing-dishes" wx:if="{{item.dishesText}}">{{item.dishesText}}</view>
        </view>
        <text class="ing-stock-tag" wx:if="{{item.inStock}}">家里有</text>
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="actions" style="margin-top:22rpx">
      <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="goPantry">管理库存</view>
      <view class="btn" bindtap="onResetShopping">清空采购勾选</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card" wx:else>
    <view class="card-title">食材采购</view>
    <view class="muted">
      菜单里的菜还没有食材配置，所以这里是空的。食材来自每道菜的「食材」字段——去「家宴设置与菜库」点一下「补全食材」。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在统计…</view>
</view>
